edentials\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"A customer user requests a password reset\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the request contains the customer email address and the screen shows the reset-link-by-email confirmation returned by the API\",\n  \"when\": \"the reset request is submitted\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"A disabled or removed account attempts online sign-in or access\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows an access-denied message and no protected page or record is displayed\",\n  \"when\": \"the API returns an access-denied response\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"The API returns records for a staff member's assigned warehouses or a customer's organisation\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows only the returned records\",\n  \"when\": \"the user opens the corresponding list\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"A Quality Manager or Auditor opens a warehouse-scoped list and the API returns all-warehouse records\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned records from all warehouses\",\n  \"when\": \"the list is displayed\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"An Auditor opens a record page\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows record details without create, edit, or delete controls, and an API-refused write is shown as an error message\",\n  \"when\": \"the page renders\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"A protected request is refused because the account or record is inaccessible\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows an access-ended or access-denied message and clears protected record fields\",\n  \"when\": \"the web app receives the refusal\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A Customer Administrator opens user management for their organisation\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the invitation or removal status returned by the API\",\n  \"when\": \"the administrator submits an invitation or removal\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"The API refuses a user-management action, including an action for another organisation\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned error message and does not show the other organisation's user as changed\",\n  \"when\": \"the administrator submits the action\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A System Administrator searches by product name or code or opens a deactivated product\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows matching product records and identifies deactivated products as unavailable for ordering\",\n  \"when\": \"the API returns matching products and active states\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A System Administrator submits an incomplete profile or one with overlapping or gapped tiers\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the validation error returned by the API and does not show the product as saved\",\n  \"when\": \"the administrator attempts to save\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A System Administrator submits a valid profile with tiers, reason, and effective date\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the request includes the profile tiers, reason, and effective date and the screen shows the new profile version returned by the API\",\n  \"when\": \"the profile change is submitted\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A product has multiple profile versions\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen lists earlier versions with their returned values, reason, effective date, and creator where returned, and provides no e