the screen sends only one order-submission request\",\n  \"when\": \"the customer repeats the submission\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-15\",\n  \"given\": \"A Dispatcher opens an order in Packed or later status and the API returns cancellation as available\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-15.6\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the dispatcher cancellation control and the returned cancellation response or error message\",\n  \"when\": \"the Dispatcher opens the order or submits cancellation\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-16\",\n  \"given\": \"An order line is allocated across lots\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-16.1\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows each returned lot, expiry date, allocated quantity, line split, and outstanding quantity separately\",\n  \"when\": \"a Dispatcher or customer opens allocation details\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-16\",\n  \"given\": \"A Dispatcher selects an alternative lot\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-16.2\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows a required reason field and the request includes the chosen lot and reason, while the screen shows the accepted allocation or returned refusal message\",\n  \"when\": \"the override form renders and is submitted\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-16\",\n  \"given\": \"The API reports back order, complete-only status, or no suitable stock\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-16.3\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned allocation status and outstanding quantity\",\n  \"when\": \"the Dispatcher opens the order\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-16\",\n  \"given\": \"Allocated stock becomes On Hold, Rejected, Recalled, or Expired\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-16.4\",\n  \"level\": \"ui\",\n  \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned removed allocation, replacement allocation outcome, outstanding quantity, and dispatcher message or notification outcome when returned\",\n  \"when\": \"the order view refreshes\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-16\",\n  \"given\": \"Stock allocated to an order i